### 유저 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "alice"}

### 이름 누락
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### 조회 단건
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

### 존재 안할 때
GET http://localhost:8080/users/99999999

### 쿼리로
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1?id=1